<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:35:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>打造 Clockwork：一款用 Kane CLI 做端到端验证的 AI 原生 2D 游戏引擎</title><link>https://dev.to/theatomicshift/building-clockwork-an-ai-native-2d-game-engine-verified-end-to-end-with-kane-cli-3j2n</link><description>浏览器里的 2D 引擎把场景、行为、规则与 HUD 收进同一个窗口，Kane CLI 再驱动真实 Chrome 验证编辑器与游戏全链路可用。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:44:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1966f8247b6d85958cb724e694b228e2d950cd0d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/theatomicshift/building-clockwork-an-ai-native-2d-game-engine-verified-end-to-end-with-kane-cli-3j2n">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Godot 4：图像尺寸必须与纹理的图像尺寸一致</title><link>https://dev.to/yirenlabs/godot-4-image-size-must-match-textures-image-size-4b9h</link><description>往 ImageTextureLayered 逐层上传纹理时尺寸或格式稍有不符就会被静默驳回，这篇排错笔记讲清了报错成因与排查思路。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:46:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7d05ea3626fad0bf877cf39f0e8a9c5f3de31ba0</guid><source url="https://dev.to/yirenlabs/godot-4-image-size-must-match-textures-image-size-4b9h">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《生化危机 4 重制版》领跑本世代重制游戏销量，1680 万份背后是 Steam 长尾</title><link>https://dev.to/mango7777/resident-evil-4-remake-dominates-current-gen-remake-sales-with-168m-copies-steams-long-tail-57fg</link><description>市场机构 Alinea 的新估算显示，《生化危机 4 重制版》已卖出 1680 万份，Steam 长尾销售是收入的重要推手。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">22dd80f96946935b34048387a6e83c7ebb0d3b33</guid><source url="https://dev.to/mango7777/resident-evil-4-remake-dominates-current-gen-remake-sales-with-168m-copies-steams-long-tail-57fg">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>闭环验证：Clockwork 内置 AI 智能体如何用 Kane CLI 检验它生成的游戏</title><link>https