-week-character-style-test-before-you-commit-to-stylised-or-realistic</link><description>很多小团队凭一次会议就定下角色风格，作者建议用两周时间做一次有结构的风格测试，再决定美术方向，避免过早锁死招聘、工具选择与发行谈判。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:41:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">20d6b87653892383ceef44167e2dac642a8899b4</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298739-running-a-two-week-character-style-test-before-you-commit-to-stylised-or-realistic">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>Roblox 与英国 PRS for Music 签署音乐授权协议</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/roblox-signs-music-licensing-agreement-with-prs-for-music</link><description>Roblox 与英国音乐版权机构 PRS for Music 达成授权协议，平台上被使用的音乐将从 2027 年起向词曲作者与出版方支付版税，为创作者开辟新的收入来源。</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:33:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6fa5950e9f5c4a3234e87b8f4e2e2acc41c8317b</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/roblox-signs-music-licensing-agreement-with-prs-for-music">PocketGamer.biz</source></item></channel></rss>
